      factPt: 'O sinal egípcio do remo tem o valor sonoro <i>ḫrw</i>, "voz", o mesmo do epíteto <span class="gloss" data-gloss="justo-de-voz">"justo de voz"</span>.',
      factEn: 'The Egyptian oar sign carries the sound value <i>ḫrw</i>, "voice", the same as in the epithet <span class="gloss" data-gloss="justo-de-voz">"true of voice"</span>.'
